.el .ds Aq '
.TH garuda-toolbox-services 1  "garuda-toolbox 6.3.0" 
.SH NAME
garuda\-toolbox\-services \- List, start, stop and enable services, the system\*(Aqs and your own
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgaruda\-toolbox services\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR \fIWHEN\fR] [\fB\-\-width\fR \fICOLUMNS\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List, start, stop and enable services, the system\*(Aqs and your own
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print the programs\*(Aq own words under an error
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR
Print long text directly instead of through `$PAGER`
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Colour the output: auto, always or never
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-width\fR \fI<COLUMNS>\fR
Cut long cells to this many columns
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Leave out the spinner and the hints
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-services\-list(1)
List the services and their state
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-services\-show(1)
Show one service: its description, its state and whether it starts at boot
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-services\-start(1)
Start a service now. Refused when it runs already
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-services\-stop(1)
Stop a service now. Refused when it is not running
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-services\-restart(1)
Restart a service now
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-services\-reload(1)
Reload a service\*(Aqs configuration now
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-services\-enable(1)
Start a service at boot
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-services\-disable(1)
Stop starting a service at boot
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-services\-mask(1)
Mask a service, so nothing can start it
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-services\-unmask(1)
Unmask a masked service
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  garuda\-toolbox services list \-\-user
  garuda\-toolbox services restart sshd.service
.SH "SEE ALSO"
garuda\-toolbox(1)
